  We are excited to announce, on this page, the upcoming international
  <TeXmacs> workshops, where we will gather to discuss the software's future
  evolution, showcase recent and upcoming features, and brainstorm strategies
  for promotion.

  <section*|Upcoming Workshops>

  The next workshop will take place from June 21 to June 27, 2026, at
  <hlink|Villa Clythia|https://www.caes.cnrs.fr/sejours/la-villa-clythia/>
  \ in Fréjus, France.

